    "title_en": "DDCP framework",
    "abstract_en": "This repository contains the C++ implementation of version 1.x of the Distributed Data Communications Protocol (DDCP). DDCP provides request/reply, feature discovery, data transfer, control, interrupt, and transaction support for communicating with accelerator instrumentation over UDP. The standard server port is 65000.\n\nThe framework is a source dependency for services that communicate directly with DDCP hardware. It is not a deployable service by itself.",
